ZORR MODE

LOGICAL_AGENT = LESTER
ROLE = TECH / REFERENCE ANALYSIS BASE
PARENT = #228
OWNER_SOURCE_CONTRACT = `ZORR_REFERENCE_TO_DRAWING_ENGINE_MATH.md`
SOURCE_CONTRACT_SHA256 = `a5926ba1f169d74a5562bd158ab6dc769090467aa7a1146541bd8a565bcac3c8`
MAIN_HEAD_OBSERVED = `b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`
STATE = ASSIGNED / ANALYSIS-ONLY / NO RENDER / NO IMAGE GENERATION

## OBJECTIVE
Build the first deterministic `REFERENCE -> STRUCTURE STATE` slice required by the OWNER math contract. This is upstream of SALVADOR/ComfyUI and must work without diffusion, prompts, or image generation.

## REUSE-FIRST STACK
Primary upstream:
- `opencv/opencv`
- exact inspected ref: `2ea6598f64f6f03d9d08db084a60585b0fc585f1`
- repository license: Apache-2.0

Optional measurement aid only:
- `google-ai-edge/mediapipe`
- exact inspected ref: `251c0cb9687230682929a64d413751f1a4f8a6d5`
- repository license: Apache-2.0
- MUST NOT infer or authorize hidden anatomy.

Use OpenCV native primitives rather than reimplementing algorithms:
- color conversion for luminance/Lab analysis;
- Sobel/Scharr for derivatives;
- Canny only when a binary edge map is explicitly needed;
- morphology / distance transform for masks and thickness/distance measurements;
- `findContours` for contour topology;
- native contour approximation (`approxPolyDP` or existing OpenCV approximation path) for simplification.

No custom edge detector, custom contour tracer, custom pose model, custom vectorizer, custom anatomy solver, or generative model.

## HARD EVIDENCE LAW
Every emitted element must have exactly one provenance state:
`OBSERVED | DERIVED | STYLE_TRANSFORM | UNKNOWN`.

In this issue the analyzer may emit only `OBSERVED`, `DERIVED`, or `UNKNOWN`. `STYLE_TRANSFORM` belongs to a later renderer.

Hidden anatomy, hidden costume, hidden props, unseen geometry and unseen background structure are never inferred as fact. `UNKNOWN` remains unresolved.

## REQUIRED LAYERS
Emit and preserve equivalents of:
- L0 source RGB;
- L1 luminance/value;
- L2 continuous gradient field;
- L3 visible silhouette;
- L4 internal contours;
- L5 semantic/region color masses where supported;
- L6 visible anchors only;
- L7 occlusion ordering where directly evidenced;
- L8 material/texture frequency summary;
- L9 lighting evidence summary;
- L10 uncertainty mask.

Do not make prompt prose geometry authority.

## FIRST OUTPUT CONTRACT
For one input reference, produce a machine-readable structure-state artifact containing at minimum:
- source width/height in original pixels;
- visible bbox in pixels;
- visible silhouette representation;
- `raw_contour` and `simplified_contour` plus simplification tolerance and pixel error to raw;
- anchors[] with `x_px`, `y_px`, normalized coordinates and provenance;
- visible proportion graph using only visible scale references;
- occlusion graph;
- color regions with area, mean Lab, variance and neighbor boundaries when supported;
- tone-field summary;
- texture-frequency summary;
- uncertainty mask;
- provenance per element;
- exact upstream refs / versions / parameters used.

Original pixel measurements are authoritative. Normalized coordinates exist only for cross-resolution comparison; never round-trip exact placement through normalized space.

## QC VECTOR — REPORT, DO NOT COLLAPSE
Keep separate metrics:
`E_silhouette_px`
`E_anchor_px`
`E_proportion`
`E_occlusion`
`E_tone`
`E_color`
`E_texture`
`E_line_topology`

Do not invent a global weighted score or PASS threshold.
Do not invent universal Canny thresholds, contour tolerances, color-cluster counts, line widths, or texture thresholds. Parameters must be recorded and source/style-specific.

## FAIL-CLOSED RULES
- predicted/occluded landmark used to draw hidden anatomy = FAIL;
- UNKNOWN promoted to geometry = FAIL;
- binary edge threshold treated as universal truth = FAIL;
- silhouette failure hidden by texture/style changes = FAIL;
- contour simplification that deletes a required visible feature without reporting error = FAIL;
- geometry modified to accommodate preferred line weight = FAIL;
- prompt/diffusion result used as structure authority = FAIL;
- renderer work started before structure-state artifact exists = FAIL.

## NO-RENDER BOUNDARY
This issue does NOT authorize:
- new image generation;
- editing a source image;
- drawing/stylization output;
- ComfyUI/IP-Adapter/ControlNet integration;
- Babylon scene mutation;
- canon/Character Truth mutation.

## REQUIRED HANDOFF
`REFERENCE_ANALYSIS_BASE_R01_READY`
`SOURCE_CONTRACT_SHA256 = a5926ba1f169d74a5562bd158ab6dc769090467aa7a1146541bd8a565bcac3c8`
`OPENCV_REF = 2ea6598f64f6f03d9d08db084a60585b0fc585f1`
`MEDIAPIPE_USED = YES|NO`
`SOURCE_SHA256 = <real reference hash>`
`STRUCTURE_STATE = <artifact path/hash>`
`L0_L10 = PASS|PARTIAL with exact missing evidence`
`PROVENANCE = PASS|FAIL`
`UNKNOWN_PRESERVED = PASS|FAIL`
`QC_VECTOR = <reported values / NOT_APPLICABLE where no drawing candidate exists>`
`CUSTOM_CV_ALGORITHM = NO`
`IMAGE_GENERATION = NO`
`IMAGE_EDITING = NO`
`RENDERER = NOT STARTED`
`MERGE = NO`
`NEXT = DUNCAN independent structure-state QC`

ASSIGNED != RUNNING. Do not claim RUNNING until an isolated implementation/execution context exists and the first real reference-analysis command/test has actually run.
